{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2JN","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"约翰二书","commonName":"约翰二书","title":"约翰二书","order":63,"numberOfChapters":1,"sha256":"560099733a7267915a9771c66a209e42e1dafc589cd70ce0100257b92f750a93","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2JN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":1,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2JN/1.json","totalNumberOfVerses":13},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我这做长老的写信给蒙拣选的女士",{"noteId":0},"和你的儿女，就是我本着真理所爱的。不但我爱你们，一切认识真理的人也都爱你们，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["这是因为真理在我们里面，并且永远与我们同在。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["父上帝和祂儿子耶稣基督的恩典、怜悯和平安，必在真理和爱中与我们同在！"]},{"type":"heading","content":["彼此相爱"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我看见你一些儿女按照我们从父领受的命令遵行真理，感到非常欣慰。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["女士啊，我现在劝你，我们要彼此相爱。这不是新命令，而是我们从起初就已经领受的命令。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["爱就是遵行上帝的命令。你们要活出爱，这是你们从起初就听到的命令。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["提防骗子"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["因为许多骗子已经来到世上，他们否认耶稣基督曾降世为人。这样的人是骗子，是敌基督者。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["你们要谨慎，好得到完满的赏赐，免得我们前功尽弃。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["凡偏离基督教导的人，都没有上帝；凡遵守基督教导的人，都有父和子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["若有人到你们那里不传基督的教导，不要请他到家里，也不要问候他，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["因为问候他就是与他同流合污。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["结语"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我还有许多事要告诉你们，但不想借助纸墨，只希望到你们那里当面畅谈，使我们喜乐满溢。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["你那蒙拣选之姊妹的儿女问候你。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"学者一般认为“蒙拣选的女士”是指教会。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":1}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2JN/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/3JN/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1JN/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}